<title>USA: FelCor completes purchase of three hotels.</title>
<headline>FelCor completes purchase of three hotels.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>FelCor Suite Hotels Inc said Thursday it completed its acquisition of three Doubletree Guest Suites hotels from PSH Master L.P. 1 for a total purchase price of $71.2 million.</p>
<p>The unit holders of PSH Master L.P. 1 approved the sale of the hotels last week, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>The purchase price includes a payment to terminate the existing management agreements in place at the three hotels. Doubletree Hotels will continue to manage the hotels under new agreements, FelCor said.</p>
</text>
